    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n5:29 am from Evans Station\r\n7:09 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n9:39 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n11:54 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n2:10 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n5:56 am from Union Station Track 12\r\n8:26 am from Union Station Track 12\r\n10:41 am from Union Station Track 12\r\n12:57 pm from Union Station Track 12"
